{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32156","headline":"碌碌古词 · 温庭筠","name":"碌碌古词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左亦不碌碌，右亦不碌碌。\n野草自根肥，羸牛生健犊。\n融蜡作杏蒂，男儿不恋家。\n春风破红意，女颊如桃花。\n忠言未见信，巧语翻咨嗟。\n一鞘无两刃，徒劳油壁车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}